{
 "encounter_id": "00814",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Hello. I'm giving up smoking, I did my last one on Monday, and I'm worried about my cough, because it's got worse since I stopped, and I thought it'd be better."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "First of all, well done. That's the best thing you can do for your health. Tell me about the cough."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It's a wet, hacking cough, mostly in the morning. I bring up grey phlegm. It was always there, but it's heavier now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How long have you had the cough, before and after stopping?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Years, really. Three or four. And the extra bit, since Monday."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "How much did you smoke?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Twenty-five a day, for thirty years."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any breathlessness, wheeze, or chest tightness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "A bit puffed on the stairs. And a wheeze, sometimes, at night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any blood in the phlegm?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. None."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever, or weight loss?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever. No weight loss. I've put some on, from the sweets."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any chest pain? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Do you have any conditions?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "High blood pressure. That's it."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Let me check your numbers. Pulse, oxygen, and so on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Go on. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Pulse 82, oxygen 95 percent, blood pressure 136 over 84, temperature 36.7, weight 85 kilos.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the oxygen low? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's a little lower than ideal, which fits with a smoker's lungs. Take some slow breaths for me, and I'll listen.",
   "pause": 18.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's some wheeze, particularly when you breathe out, and a few crackles at the bases, and your breathing out takes longer than normal."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "What does that mean? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "With your history and the cough, wheeze and breathlessness, this suggests chronic obstructive pulmonary disease, COPD, caused by smoking."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Oh no. I've quit. Is it too late? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's never too late. Stopping smoking is the most important treatment, and it slows the damage. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "To be sure, I'd like to arrange a breathing test, spirometry, and a chest X-ray."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "When? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This week. And the cough often gets a little worse in the first weeks after stopping, as your airways start to clear. That's a good sign. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's reassuring. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Would you like help with stopping? We can offer you support and nicotine replacement. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Yes. I'd like that. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'll refer you to the stop smoking service today."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Thank you. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "If the cough turns green or yellow with fever, you cough up blood, or you get very breathless, come back or call 999."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "I will. ~"
  }
 ],
